'''Night Oracle Rei''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. This unit is a variant of [[Miko Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|Mitama the Oracle]] with various different attributes. She was added in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 547
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Night Oracle Rei
|name2 = Heavenly Herald Rei
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Heavenly Herald Rei''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Despite seeming similar, this unit has worse stats and abilities than Mitama the Oracle.

Compared to [[Miko Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|Mitama the Oracle]], this unit has far less survivability, due to lower health and 1/3 the knockbacks. She has 100 less piercing range on her attacks, slightly lower damage and a much shorter-lasting debuff, but, in return, she is usable in stages with Surge Attacks (most notably the [[Surge Base (Enemy Base)|Surge Base]]) and in the Evangelion Collaboration Stages due to her EVA Angel Killer. The only advantage she might have over Mitama is her Surge Attack, but it suffers from inconsistency, both in proc rates and spawn location. It can allow her Slow to reach backliners, but again, inconsistency is an issue.

In general, she's a good debuffer who may take a while to dispose of and, although not as powerful as Miko Mitama, she can still bring a lot to a fight, especially when she's not at risk of being outranged.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Sniper}}

