==Trivia==
*This is the first cat to be a variant of a fest-exclusive unit.
*The evolved form has references like Gendo's glasses, [[EVA Unit-00 (Uber Rare Cat)|EVA Unit-00]]'s shield, an N² Missile, the cooking pot, the letter invite to the dinner party, and the bed that Rei was wheeled in on while injured.
*The mini Reis may be a reference to the original Neon Genesis Evangelion anime where the Angel [[wikipedia:Angels in Neon Genesis Evangelion#Armisael|Armisael]] comes into contact with Rei, producing similar growths of mini Reis.

